{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../dpop_auth/", "title": "Dpop Auth"}, "next": {"link": "../../auth_types/", "title": "Auth Types"}, "title": "Client Assertion", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_schemes.client_assertion\">\n<span id=\"client-assertion\"></span><h1>Client Assertion<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_schemes.client_assertion\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE\" title=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.build_client_assertion\" title=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.build_client_assertion\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">build_client_assertion</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Mint a private_key_jwt client assertion for token-endpoint authentication (RFC 7523).</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.validate_client_assertion_key\" title=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.validate_client_assertion_key\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_client_assertion_key</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0None)</p></td>\n<td><p>Verify the signing key and algorithm can produce a client assertion.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.build_client_assertion\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_schemes.client_assertion.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">build_client_assertion</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">private_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">issuer</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">alg</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'RS256'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.build_client_assertion\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Mint a private_key_jwt client assertion for token-endpoint authentication (RFC 7523).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>private_key</strong> \u2013 The client\u2019s private signing key (PKCS8 PEM string or bytes).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>client_id</strong> \u2013 The Auth0 client ID, used as both the issuer and subject claim.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>issuer</strong> \u2013 The authorization server issuer identifier, used as the audience claim.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>alg</strong> \u2013 The signing algorithm (defaults to \u201cRS256\u201d).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The signed client-assertion JWT.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.validate_client_assertion_key\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_schemes.client_assertion.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_client_assertion_key</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">private_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">alg</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'RS256'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.validate_client_assertion_key\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Verify the signing key and algorithm can produce a client assertion.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>private_key</strong> \u2013 The client\u2019s private signing key (PKCS8 PEM string or bytes).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>alg</strong> \u2013 The signing algorithm (defaults to \u201cRS256\u201d).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 If the key is malformed or does not match the algorithm.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_schemes.client_assertion.CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_schemes.client_assertion.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_types/index", "Auth Types", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_schemes/dpop_auth/index", "Dpop Auth", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_schemes/client_assertion/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Client Assertion</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#functions\">Functions</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.build_client_assertion\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">build_client_assertion()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.validate_client_assertion_key\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_client_assertion_key()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_schemes.client_assertion.CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIENT_ASSERTION_TYPE</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth_schemes/client_assertion/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}